هذه **مجاميع إجمالية مشروطة للسيناريو** وليست أمرًا نهائيًا بصرف صافي المستحقات. تُضاف الأرصدة المستحقة المثبتة، ولا تُخصم إلا الحسميات النظامية المؤيدة، مع تجنب تكرار صرف أجر سبتمبر. ويستلزم تغيير تاريخ الإنهاء إعادة الحساب. `[review]`

**Step 3 — Notice, settlement, documents and deadlines**

**Notice.** Article 75 requires at least 60 days’ written employer notice for this contract category. From 2026-09-04 to 2026-09-30 there are **26 elapsed days**, leaving **34 days** against that minimum.  
`[computed — labor-law.md Art. 75, settled 2026-09-04; inputs: effective notice 2026-09-04, termination 2026-09-30, notice day excluded, statutory period 60 calendar days]` `[review]`

The amended Article 76 requires an amount equal to the wage for the notice period: **“عن مهلة الإشعار مبلغاً مساوياً لأجر العامل عن المهلة نفسها”**. The previous wording expressly mentioning the remainder was removed. Accordingly, the reference file’s full-period reading supplies the principal provision; the shortfall-only amount is an alternative requiring counsel’s confirmation of court treatment.  
[BOE Labor Law, Article 76 amendment](https://laws.boe.gov.sa/BoeLaws/Laws/LawDetails/08381293-6388-48e2-8ad2-a9a700f2aa94/1). `[BOE — Arabic]` `[review]`

If counsel approves the ground, another option is to preserve employment through a full notice period, with paid garden leave if appropriate. Article 78 preserves service and wage consequences during garden leave and grants paid job-search absence during employer notice.  
`labor-law.md`, Art. 78. `[settled — last confirmed 2026-09-04]`

**Portal effectiveness.** Use the Portal’s approved notice service and retain evidence of delivery. Annex 5 permits alternative channels where no relevant Portal service exists; an ordinary letter or email should not be assumed sufficient where the service exists. `[review]`  
`labor-law-implementing-regulations.md`, Annex 5 cl. 14.1. `[settled — last confirmed 2026-09-04]`

